SUMMARY:Sierra Nevada Brewing Co. ~ Haus Party/Oktoberfest! Music\, Food\,
  & Beer! 🎵 🥨🍺
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Hélène will be hosting this fun 
 event at Sierra Nevada Brewing Co. in Mills River. Thanks\, Hélène\, for
  hosting and also for suggesting it for our group! 🤩**\n\n**Sierra Neva
 da Brewing Co. will be having their Haus Party in the Park/Oktoberfest in 
 the lower park. Performance by Lagerhosen & the Concord Brass Band from 4-
 8 PM.**\n\n**COST: Free event!**\n\n**PETS: 🐶 Dogs are welcome!**\n\n**
 PARKING: 🅿️ Ample parking available.**\n\n**SEATING: Limited seating.
  You may want to bring a blanket to sit on or a portable camp chair.**\n\n
 **FOOD/DRINK: 🥨🍺 German-inspired food. Lots and lots of beer! You ma
 y want to bring your own water thou ~ especially if the weather is still q
 uite warm. 💧**\n\n**WEBSITE: www.sierranevada.com**\n\n**TO FIND YOUR H
 OST: Hélène will be waiting for you at 3:30 PM right inside the main doo
 rs of the brewery or right outside the doors depending on the weather. To 
 recognize her scroll down to photos. She is the attractive lady dressed in
  purple with white hair.**\n\n**Come on out! Lots of good music\, food\, a
 nd\, of course\, beer! Prost! 🍻**\n\n**QUESTIONS??**\n**Contact Hélèn
 e ~ (864)346-7546 (Call or text)**
