SUMMARY:Fork and Plough Restaurant ~ Greenville\, S.C. (Meetup after the G
 reenville Zoo)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**NOTE:** **First of all\, this meet
 up is open to all members whether you go to the zoo or not.**\n\n**The For
 k & Plough is a casual\, farm-to-table restaurant\, butcher shop and marke
 t located in the Historic Overbrook neighborhood.**\n\n**Their menu is upd
 ated twice daily ~ lunch and dinner ~ for their food is seasonal. They als
 o have a full bar if you wish to have a beer\, wine\, or cocktail with you
 r meal. 🍺 🍷 🍹**\n\n**WEBSITE/MENU:** **www.forkandplough.com**\n\
 n**PARKING: 🅿️** **There is onsite parking\, but if the lot is full y
 ou may park down the street at the Overbrook Baptist Church. They have an 
 agreement with the restaurant so you will not be towed. 🚗**\n\n**RESERV
 ATIONS:** **We will have reservations for 12:45 PM.**\n\n**By the way\, th
 e restaurant is only 1.3 - 1.8 miles from the zoo. A 5-6 minute drive. Con
 venient\, eh? 🚙**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\
 n**(828)699-8180 (Call or text)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31596198
