SUMMARY:Texas Roadhouse - Time for a Good Steak! 🥩
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**The Texas Roadhouse is** **an** **
 affordable country-themed steakhouse famous for its hand-cut steaks 🥩 a
 nd warm yeast rolls with honey & cinnamon butter. If you’re not a steak 
 person they also offer seafood and other food items on their menu.**\n\n**
 They have a full bar\, and they are known for their legendary margaritas 
 🍹and specialty cocktails like the Jamaican Cowboy 🤠 and Texas Peach 
 Fuzz! And\, of course\, they have wine and beer\, too. 🍷🍺**\n\n**NOT
 E:** **The Texas Roadhouse can get very crowded with long wait times on th
 e weekends. Also\, they do not take reservations. Therefore\, I made our m
 eetup on a Thursday and at an earlier time. Hopefully\, that will give us 
 less of a wait time and we all can sit together.**\n\n**WEBSITE/MENU:** **
 www.texasroadhouse.com**\n\n**PARKING:🅿️** **Plenty of parking availa
 ble.**\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae (828)699-8180 (Call or text)**\n**Shae.ke
 merer@aol.com**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31623028
