SUMMARY:Jeter Mountain Farm & Apple Orchard 🍎 ~ Apple Cider Donuts\, Pu
 mpkins\, & More!
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Jeter Mountain Farm & Apple Orchar
 d is family-owned and offers so much to see and do! There is the u-pick or
 chard with 25 varieties of apples\, u-pick flowers\, their in-house smoked
  BBQ - The 1813 Smokehouse\, the hard cider taproom\, coffee shop\, ice cr
 eam parlor\, and their market place with gifts & local goods. I can’t wa
 it to eat some BBQ and eat a couple of their warm\, apple cider donuts! 
 🍎🍩 😋**\n\n**TRACTOR-PULLED WAGON RIDES:** **$4 per person. They t
 ake you deep in the growing fields. Who’s going to join me? Fun! 🚜 
 🤩**\n\n**WEBSITE:** **To see all they offer and information about the f
 arm & orchard. www.jetermountainfarm.com**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️** **Parki
 ng shouldn’t be too bad for our meetup is a half hour after they open an
 d on a week day.**\n\n**PET-FRIENDLY:** **Yes\, Fido is welcome! 🐶**\n\
 n**Note:** **A big thanks to Famia G. for suggesting this event. Famia wil
 l also be co-hosting. 💕**\n\n**Hope to see you there!**\n\n**QUESTIONS/
 CONCERNS:**\n**Shae Kemerer (828)699-8180 (call or text)**\n**Shae.kemerer
 @aol.com**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31640337
